{"id":9242674823396,"title":"Pocket Era R36S Ultra","handle":"pocket-era-r36s-ultra","description":"\u003ch2\u003ePocket Era R36S Ultra Retro Handheld Console\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eR36S Ultra\u003c\/strong\u003e has a \u003cstrong\u003e4 inch fully laminated IPS screen\u003c\/strong\u003e at 720 x 720, \u003cstrong\u003ebuilt-in Wi-Fi\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003edual joysticks lit in seven colors\u003c\/strong\u003e, with an \u003cstrong\u003eRK3326\u003c\/strong\u003e chip and 1GB of RAM behind it. Up to 40,000 games preloaded across 20+ systems, ready to play out of the box.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy the R36S Ultra\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA 4 inch HD screen.\u003c\/strong\u003e 720 x 720 IPS, fully laminated, for clear and vibrant visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWi-Fi built in.\u003c\/strong\u003e Play multiplayer with friends, no external adapter needed.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLit joysticks.\u003c\/strong\u003e Both sticks light up, with seven colors to choose from.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmooth play.\u003c\/strong\u003e 1GB of high-frequency LPDDR3 RAM keeps games running smoothly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e8GB system storage.\u003c\/strong\u003e Built-in eMMC storage that supports system recovery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eFour finishes\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThree of the four shells are \u003cstrong\u003etransparent\u003c\/strong\u003e (Black, Blue and Purple) and let you see straight inside, the way the clear consoles of the 90s did. White is the clean, classic pick.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eChoose your storage\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e64GB\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e15,000+ games preloaded\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e128GB\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e40,000+ games preloaded. The Max Bundle also includes a clear daily case, a hard shell travel case and a screen protector.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eAdd your own games\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCopy your own game files over from a computer and they show up in the menu next to the preloaded games. Only add games you own.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecs\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCPU:\u003c\/strong\u003e RK3326 Cortex-A35, 1.5GHz\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGPU:\u003c\/strong\u003e Mali-G31 MP2, OpenGL ES 3.2\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRAM:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1GB LPDDR3\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSystem storage:\u003c\/strong\u003e 8GB eMMC, supports system recovery\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4 inch IPS, 720 x 720, OCA fully laminated\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGames:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15,000+ (64GB) or 40,000+ (128GB) preloaded, 20+ systems\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmulators:\u003c\/strong\u003e CPS1, CPS2, CPS3, MAME2003, Atari 5200, Atari 7800, PC Engine, FC\/NES, SFC\/SNES, N64, GB, GBC, GBA, NDS, SG-1000, Mega Drive, Game Gear, Dreamcast, Neo Geo, NGP, NGPC, PS1\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWi-Fi:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.4G, built in\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eControls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dual ADC joysticks with 7-color lights\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio:\u003c\/strong\u003e Built-in 8W cavity speaker\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3000mAh, about 5 hours of play, about 1 hour to charge\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePorts:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C charging, Type-C OTG data port, 3.5mm headphone jack\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOS:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multiple open-source Linux systems\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 145 x 85 x 30 mm (5.71 x 3.35 x 1.18 in)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 200g\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-09-23T19:37:03-05:00","created_at":"2026-09-18T16:54:33-05:00","vendor":"Pocket Era","type":"Handheld Console","t